Number_of_PV_Entries__c &gt; 0  ||

( ISPICKVAL(Type, &apos;Renewal&apos;) &amp;&amp; ISPICKVAL(StageName , &apos;Closed Lost&apos;) &amp;&amp;  

Previous_Opportunity__r.Count_of_SLR_Entries__c &gt; 0)</formula>
